1
00:00:24,733 --> 00:00:29,249
HACHAMISHI LISHMINI ELEF TSHA MEOT TISHIM USHMONE,

2
00:00:30,538 --> 00:00:34,712
YUD GIMEL MENACHEM AV, TAV-SHIN-NUN-CHET,

3
00:00:34,712 --> 00:00:39,965
ANI MERAYENET ET HARABANIT FEIGA LEAH Derbaremdiker LEBEIT Frid.

4
00:00:41,676 --> 00:00:45,520
HASHEM SHELI TZIRA LEIZERZON, ANACHNU KAN BIYUSHALAYIM,

5
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:48,656
BEYISRAEL, VEHARAYON YEARECH BEYIDISH.

6
00:00:49,388 --> 00:00:53,988
SHMI TZIRA LEIZERZON, ANI NIMTZET BIYUSHALAYIM, MEDINAT YISRAEL,

7
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:58,531
BAYUD GIMEL BEMENACHEM AV, TAV-SHIN-NUN-CHET,

8
00:00:58,531 --> 00:01:02,814
HACHAMISHI BEUGUST ELEF TSHA MEOT TISHIM USHMONE, VEANI MERAYENET ET HARABANIT

9
00:01:03,546 --> 00:01:07,320
FEIGA LEAH Derbaremdiker BEYIDISH.

10
00:01:11,865 --> 00:01:17,378
Leye Derbaremdiker, ikh vil oyb ir kent mir dertseyln oyf di tsayt vos ir gedenkt

11
00:01:17,788 --> 00:01:27,486
in dorf vu ir zent ir hot gevoynt far di milkhome. oyf di shtub, oyf di plats, di kool dortn, di shtetl.

12
00:01:31,221 --> 00:01:36,786
koydem kol vil ikh UNK danken dem Eybershtn az ikh hob derlebt, ikh bin aroys fun dem fun dem

13
00:01:36,786 --> 00:01:38,758
gey-tsalmoves, vi azoy m'zogt.

14
00:01:38,933 --> 00:01:42,251
tsu redn iber dem iz zeyer zeyer shver.

15
00:01:42,375 --> 00:01:46,284
vayl dos iz, di SHOAH iz geven a ibernatirlekhe zakh,

16
00:01:46,493 --> 00:01:49,181
vos ⟨hitsert⟩ muz men nisht farshteyn a mol, undz ze'mir,

17
00:01:49,181 --> 00:01:55,464
undz klern, gleybn mit pashtes, s'rirt zikh nisht a bletele, a GARGIR zamd on on a khezhbm.

18
00:01:55,673 --> 00:02:00,378
UNK ikh hob mikh nisht gevolt lozn MERAYEN zayn, ober azoy vi ikh hob bakumen dem briv fun di rabonim,

19
00:02:00,378 --> 00:02:05,268
az undz darf'mir gedenken vos Amolek hot undz getun, hob ikh maskem geven.

20
00:02:05,562 --> 00:02:11,664
ikh shtam fun der Bukovine. dos iz geven a mol Estraykh.

21
00:02:11,974 --> 00:02:15,225
di shtot hot geheysn Radoz, dos iz lebn Tshernovits.

22
00:02:15,417 --> 00:02:16,896
vi hot ir gezogt di shtot?

23
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:19,831
Radauts, Redevits in yidish.

24
00:02:17,577 --> 00:02:20,473
Radots. aha.

25
00:02:21,458 --> 00:02:27,004
a shtetl, a yidish shtetl, ikh meyn mit yidishe balebatim.

26
00:02:27,904 --> 00:02:35,323
geven balbatim vos hobn geshikt afile di kinder keyn Lublin in in di yeshives. undz aleyn iz iz nisht geven keyn yeshives in

27
00:02:35,650 --> 00:02:41,364
in shtot, SO un den di eyntsike yeshive vos hot ekzistirt iz geven Vizhnits un dortn zenen

28
00:02:41,505 --> 00:02:51,624
hobn gelernt di ale UNK mayn man un di a- ale UNK, der vos hot gevolt shikn a kind tsu der yeshive hobn geshikt in der Vizhnitser yeshive. dos iz geven nisht vayt fun undz, dos hot nokh gehert tsu der Bukovine.

29
00:02:52,980 --> 00:02:56,551
ikh bin geboyrn in JAHRE eyn toyznt nayn hundert finef un tsvontsik.

30
00:02:56,828 --> 00:03:01,057
biz tsvelef yor hob ikh gehat borekh-hashem zeyer a sheyne yugnt.

31
00:03:01,249 --> 00:03:06,137
sheyne yidishe shtub, a balbate yidishe shtub, undz ze'mir nisht geven keyn milyonern,

32
00:03:06,210 --> 00:03:12,330
mayn tate hot gehat a kleyn BETRIEB, vi azoy m'ruft es do, a kleyn BEIT CHAROSHET zog'mir.

33
00:03:13,534 --> 00:03:16,835
un m'hot gehat borekh-hashem parnose beshefe.

34
00:03:17,382 --> 00:03:22,742
anfang, als yung kind, iz nokh nisht geven keyn Beys-Yankev shul, hot iz geven a melamed in shtub.

35
00:03:23,254 --> 00:03:26,454
iz dos rov hot er gelernt mit mayne kleyne brider,

36
00:03:26,865 --> 00:03:29,981
un tsum alef-beys hot er iz oykh undz gelernt.

37
00:03:30,021 --> 00:03:33,424
s'geven a kertse tsayt biz s'hot zikh erefnt di Beys-Yankev shul.

38
00:03:33,987 --> 00:03:39,448
ze'mir, ober vos iz geven di BAYA? m'hot gemuzt, s'a flikht geven tsu geyn in di rumenishe folkshuln.

39
00:03:40,551 --> 00:03:44,426
ober s'nokh geven a demokratish land, Rumenyen iz demolts nokh geven,

40
00:03:44,668 --> 00:03:48,003
m'hot nisht getsvungen tsu gornisht, undz ho'mir nisht gehat keyn shverikeytn.

41
00:03:48,043 --> 00:03:51,159
gekent gemuzt afile shabes geyn in shul.

42
00:03:52,937 --> 00:03:58,077
s'geven a sakh shuln, a Vizhnitser shul, a Byaler shul,

43
00:03:58,084 --> 00:04:02,448
un m'hot gehat etlekhe rabonim fun farshidene krayzn.

44
00:04:03,045 --> 00:04:11,631
s'geven oykh mer moderne int- institutn, tsum bayshpil zeyer sheyne yidishe gebayde un a sheyne yidishe kultur's gemeyn-

45
00:04:11,631 --> 00:04:13,603
kultur's gemeynde, heyst,

46
00:04:16,326 --> 00:04:22,406
der rosh-akool iz dort gezesn, mit di mit di di firer fun der shtot, zog mir. dos vos hot geheysn di kultur's gemeynde.

47
00:04:22,406 --> 00:04:24,167
dort hot men zikh gelernt in a,

48
00:04:24,966 --> 00:04:29,769
biz biz JAHRE nayn un draysik hobn ongehoybn di umruen.

49
00:04:29,775 --> 00:04:30,562
vos,

50
00:04:29,792 --> 00:04:39,948
eyn minut. ikh vil fregn, gedenkt ir ven di Beys-Yankev hot zikh efn- ef- geefnt dortn? gedenkt ir nomen fun rabonim dortn in plats?

51
00:04:39,948 --> 00:04:42,004
in di shtetl, far di milkhome?

52
00:04:42,263 --> 00:04:47,010
nomen fun rabonim nisht, ober dem grinder fun der Beys-Yankev shul yo.

53
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:50,930
er hot geheysn reb Dovid Yosef Hekht zikhroyne-livrokhe.

54
00:04:51,055 --> 00:04:56,882
er iz geven a groyser oysher un a kinderlozer mentsh. er hot gebay- er hot geboyt di Beys-Yankev shul

55
00:04:56,882 --> 00:05:03,249
un a shul in zelbn hoyf, un er hot dos zeyer untershtitst. er hot gebrakht a lererin fun Vin,

56
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:08,008
un un azoy s'geven di aynfal, yo.

57
00:05:06,158 --> 00:05:07,569
ir hot dortn gelernt?

58
00:05:08,098 --> 00:05:10,015
fun vi azoy s'hot zikh gegrindet.

59
00:05:10,258 --> 00:05:18,701
ober vos iz geven, s'geven tsvishn take tsvishn undzer oylem iz geven fil UNK, m'hot moyre gehat far yeder nayer zakh hot men moyre gehat.

60
00:05:18,701 --> 00:05:22,641
ober vos, mayn tate olev-asholem flegt er farshteyn az di kinder darfn hobn,

61
00:05:22,641 --> 00:05:24,861
iz er geven tsvishn di ershte fun undz ze'mir gegangen,

62
00:05:24,861 --> 00:05:28,241
nokh vos der tate arayn in komite, komite heyst vaad.

63
00:05:27,657 --> 00:05:28,528
vaad.

64
00:05:28,315 --> 00:05:31,245
iz geven zeyer tetik az di shul zol

65
00:05:31,555 --> 00:05:35,323
zol bashteyn, un take borekh-hashem s'hot zikh gemert un gemert.

66
00:05:35,323 --> 00:05:41,702
iz ale yidishe kinder fun ale krayzn, s'geven iz geven a draysik fertsik kinder.

67
00:05:37,309 --> 00:05:39,311
vifl kinder iz dortn gevezn?

68
00:05:41,702 --> 00:05:45,841
un dos iz azoy geven. far far mitog ze'mir gegangen in der folkshul in der rumenisher,

69
00:05:46,017 --> 00:05:50,983
nokh mitog iz geven eyn lererin far ale KITOT, hot yeder gelernt a sho andert halbn.

70
00:05:50,983 --> 00:05:55,224
undz ho'mir geheysn tsvishn di groyse, ikh bin alt geven demolts draytsn fertsn yor.

71
00:05:55,855 --> 00:05:59,412
undz yen- kleyne kinder hot men getsvungen tsu lernen.

72
00:05:59,412 --> 00:06:03,673
undz ho'mir gevolt lernen. undz fleg'mir di lererin biz vu zi hot gevoynt,

73
00:06:03,673 --> 00:06:06,888
un dermit zol undz alts dertseyln, vos Sore Shnirer, v-

74
00:06:06,888 --> 00:06:10,496
ze'mir geven zeyer zeyer vayt, undz ho'mir fun gornisht gevust.

75
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:15,863
zi hot dertseylt di gantse antshtelung fun Beys-Yankev shul, vi azoy s'gevorn, vos Sore Shnirer.

76
00:06:16,577 --> 00:06:18,174
undz ho'mir nisht gehat v-

77
00:06:16,678 --> 00:06:18,649
vos hot men nokh gelernt dortn?

78
00:06:18,501 --> 00:06:19,035
vos?

79
00:06:18,649 --> 00:06:20,907
vos hot men nokh gelernt in dortn?

80
00:06:20,745 --> 00:06:22,286
vos m'hot gelernt? koydem,

81
00:06:21,370 --> 00:06:23,777
m'hot gelernt dortn tsu leyenen?

82
00:06:23,850 --> 00:06:31,556
yo, koydem di ivre vifl der melamed hot tsu undz gelernt hob ikh nor gekent dem alef-beys, vayl ikh bin gevorn a greser meydele hot shoyn der melamed nisht gekent mit undz lernen.

83
00:06:24,019 --> 00:06:24,806
vos,

84
00:06:31,562 --> 00:06:34,765
alef-beys hot er undz gelernt. nokh hot er shoyn gelernt di Beys-Yankev shul.

85
00:06:34,765 --> 00:06:36,394
hot men ongehoybn tsu lernen ivre,

86
00:06:36,394 --> 00:06:42,913
un a shtunde iz geven iberzetsung. undz ho'mir gezogt moyde-ani mit ales un brokhes ho'mir gekent vayl di mame hot undz gelernt.

87
00:06:43,071 --> 00:06:47,165
m'hot nisht gegesn umgebentshn un opgisn di hent iz geven azoy pinktlekh.

88
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:53,291
borekh-hashem iz geven shtark a sheyne yidishe shtub UNK, itst hob ikh nokh farshidene zakhn vos s'ligt mir fun kindheyt

89
00:06:53,415 --> 00:06:58,505
vos hot zikh in zikh azoy fil khumres un ikh veys nisht fun vu s'hot zikh genumen. ikh freg mayn man, zo- di mame hot azoy gelernt.

90
00:06:58,512 --> 00:07:03,484
bay undz nisht geven keyn shayle far vos, di mame hot azoy gezogt, di mame hot azoy gelernt.

91
00:07:00,334 --> 00:07:01,408
far vo-

92
00:07:04,148 --> 00:07:08,270
yo. undz ho'mir gehat a goyishe dinst, tsu molt hot di mame gehat a UNK.

93
00:07:08,270 --> 00:07:13,490
flegt zi geyn farklogn di mames, di un di hot zikh nokh nisht opgegosn di hent. ad kedey kakh iz es geven.

94
00:07:15,049 --> 00:07:18,755
oy, antshuldikts, vos hot ir mikh gefregt? ikh gedenk shoyn nisht di frage.

95
00:07:17,563 --> 00:07:22,386
ikh hob ge- yo, ikh hob gefregt vos hot men dortn gelernt,

96
00:07:22,386 --> 00:07:25,404
nor tsu leyenen, tsi mer vi tsu leyenen?

97
00:07:24,904 --> 00:07:29,871
nokh hot men undz gelernt iberzetsn dos bentshn. iz geven a shtunde fun iberzetsung.

98
00:07:29,871 --> 00:07:34,250
farshtey- ikh hob gezogt 'borekh ato hashem hazon es hakoyl'. ikh hob nisht gevust vos heyst 'hazon'.

99
00:07:34,250 --> 00:07:37,554
iz geven a shtunde vos hot geheysn a shtunde fun iberzetsung.

100
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:41,337
ho'mir azoy, iz yedes vort, tsum bayshpil 'borekh' hob ikh gevust heyst geloybt.

101
00:07:41,337 --> 00:07:47,510
ober 'hazon' oder nokh tsum bayshpil UNK ho'mir gehat aza vokabl-heft hot es geheysn, undz ho'mir zikh geshribn

102
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:51,419
un geshribn di iberzetsung az bay di tsveyte shtunde zol men shoyn,

103
00:07:51,419 --> 00:07:55,796
hot undz di lererin farhert tsi undz ken'mir iberzetsn di ershte KETA fun birkas hamozn.

104
00:07:55,954 --> 00:07:58,412
azoy langzam langzam,

105
00:07:56,308 --> 00:07:58,394
oyf rumenish tsi oyf yidish?

106
00:07:58,958 --> 00:08:01,027
ikh hob es geshribn in yidish-daytsh.

107
00:08:00,882 --> 00:08:01,551
aha.

108
00:08:01,270 --> 00:08:06,832
nisht oyf rumenish nisht, gor veynik oyf rumenish. daytsh iz geven di shprakh un s'geblibn fun Estraykh.

109
00:08:06,889 --> 00:08:08,582
s'hot geheysn a vokabl-heft

110
00:08:08,582 --> 00:08:13,987
un fun dem ho'mir in der heym gelernt un nokh fleg di lererin undz farhern tsi undz ho'mir farshtanen dem,

111
00:08:14,297 --> 00:08:20,183
nokh hot zi undz dertseylt biblishe geshikhte. zi iz geven fun Vin, zi hot shtudirt in Vin,

112
00:08:20,183 --> 00:08:23,943
ire lerer iz geven dort Dokter Doytshlender, m'hot avade fun im gehert.

113
00:08:24,338 --> 00:08:32,401
un di Sara Shnirer hot zi gezen oyf di eltere yorn, hot zi gebrakht keyn keyn Vin, hot zi zey koym gezen.

114
00:08:32,401 --> 00:08:37,775
ober di gantse ir gants lernen iz geven oyf daytsh. in daytsher shprakh un iberzetsn.

115
00:08:37,775 --> 00:08:43,332
a sakh fun di shriftn fun harav Hirsh flegt zi undz iberzetsn, s'nokh geven in gontsish a shvere shprakh.

116
00:08:43,592 --> 00:08:46,066
iz geven tsum bayshpil biblishe geshikhte.

117
00:08:46,157 --> 00:08:52,313
hot zi ongehoybn tsu dertseyln, poshet undz zol'mir oyshern. fun Avrom Ovinu un Yitskhok vi azoy hobn gehat UNK.

118
00:08:52,313 --> 00:08:58,279
s'iz nisht gloybbar haynt far hayntike kinder az mir hot men gedarft dertseyln, a meydl fun tsvelef draytsn yor,

119
00:08:58,279 --> 00:09:02,067
fun fun Breyshis, fun Avrom Ovinu, mindlekh.

120
00:09:02,067 --> 00:09:05,811
undz zol'mir oyshern, undz zol'mir hobn a kertsn iberblik iber di,

121
00:09:05,833 --> 00:09:10,653
iber di historye. far vos? vayl s'nisht geven keyn sakh tsayt, zi hot gemuzt unterrikhtn,

122
00:09:10,845 --> 00:09:16,306
zi hot nisht gekent gebn dos vos zi hot undz gegebn far a kind vos hot gedarft lernen alef-beys. undz ho'mir gelernt shpeter oyf UNK.

123
00:09:17,292 --> 00:09:19,564
un dan iz geven a bisl DIKDUK.

124
00:09:20,987 --> 00:09:28,777
vos nokh ho'mir gehat, yo, s'flegt kumen a yontev iz geven di dinim fun yontev,

125
00:09:28,952 --> 00:09:33,840
un farshidene farshidene, far vos der yontev iz un far vos alts.

126
00:09:33,947 --> 00:09:39,597
un tfile, oyf dem hot zi oyf, dos davenen. dos hot zi geleygt zeyer in DAGESH. undz zol'mir

127
00:09:39,597 --> 00:09:45,461
visn di iberzetsung fun a shmoyne-esre, vort bay, undz zol'mir visn vos undz zog'mir.

128
00:09:45,461 --> 00:09:47,992
oyf dem hot zi zeyer gegebn der kleyne tsayt

129
00:09:47,992 --> 00:09:52,031
hot undz gevolt gebn di TAMTZIOT vos a yidishe tokhter visn.

130
00:09:52,813 --> 00:09:55,996
khuts mize ho'mir zi zeyer zeyer lib gehat.

131
00:09:56,087 --> 00:09:59,928
zi hot gehat zeyer a zeyer tsugenglekhe shprakh.

132
00:09:59,968 --> 00:10:10,560
undz hobn gezogt di mame yedes vort vos zi hot undz gezogt, fleg'mir, vi m'zogt, klingen azoy vi vaser. un dos iz dos iz geven undzer fundament, mit dem bisl vos dortn geblibn bin ikh geblibn.

133
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:13,718
dos letste hob ikh gelernt fun mayne kinder do in Erets-Yisroel.

134
00:10:13,718 --> 00:10:16,466
ikh fleg oyshern vi zey flegn makhn SHIURIM, mit UNK.

135
00:10:16,540 --> 00:10:20,620
dos iz geven undzer fundament. un s'geven ober azoy min shtark.

136
00:10:22,007 --> 00:10:26,405
khuts mize az bay undz geven di emune pshute zeyer groys.

137
00:10:26,597 --> 00:10:31,231
m'hot gehaltn shabes mit ale DIKDUKIM. bay undz iz geven zeyer shtarke keltn.

138
00:10:31,643 --> 00:10:32,306
un s-

139
00:10:32,233 --> 00:10:36,682
oyb ir kent mer redn oyf shabes in shtub, in der plats, in der in shtetl.

140
00:10:36,604 --> 00:10:41,106
shabes, koydem hot men geshlosn di verkshtat

141
00:10:41,106 --> 00:10:45,373
a halbn tog farn, fraytik tsu mitog hot men geshlosn di verkshtat.

142
00:10:46,003 --> 00:10:49,797
hot men tsu ordenen gemakht in hoyf s'zol zikh nisht derkenen az s'iz avek geshlosn oyf

143
00:10:49,797 --> 00:10:53,894
toyer un shlisl. s'nor geblibn di shtub, di sheyne gortn, di sheyne hoyf,

144
00:10:54,036 --> 00:10:58,614
un m'hot zikh m'iz gegangen in mikve, m'hot gehat a sheyn bod a sheynem.

145
00:10:58,614 --> 00:11:05,235
yi- di yidn hobn dos geboyt. s'geven a shtats-bod ober di yidn hobn es geboyt. far vos, vayl zey hobn gedarft hobn di andere rituele vayl yo.

146
00:11:06,439 --> 00:11:10,258
der tate flegt nemen di yinglekh in mikve, m'hot zikh ongetun shabesdik.

147
00:11:10,258 --> 00:11:15,596
nokh iz er genumen tsvey brider UNK zenen geven kleyne kinder, zey genumen mitgenumen in shul,

148
00:11:15,602 --> 00:11:18,802
mit di peyekelekh, mit di sheyne dray-fertl hoyzn.

149
00:11:19,112 --> 00:11:22,835
un a mame azoy vi a yidish- di shtub hot geblishet.

150
00:11:22,875 --> 00:11:27,926
dos vayse tishtekh un di sheyne vayse bahenger, tsum bayshpil,

151
00:11:27,926 --> 00:11:32,457
bay undz iz geven a sakh hant-arbet. m'hot basheftikt di yidishe tokhter in shtub mit hant-arbet.

152
00:11:32,457 --> 00:11:34,884
on a shir, di bayshpil alts iz geven bahongen,

153
00:11:34,975 --> 00:11:38,866
tsum bayshpil eyn iz geven aza

154
00:11:39,413 --> 00:11:44,827
azoy vi a tishte- dos iz geven azoy vi a mats- a a khale-tishtekhl, oyfgehongen bay di vant,

155
00:11:46,264 --> 00:11:51,441
milkhiks f- vos iz geven iber di shafkele vu s'geven shoyn. UNK s'nokh geven andere mine shafkelekh.

156
00:11:50,466 --> 00:11:51,675
yo.

157
00:11:51,441 --> 00:11:56,872
milkhiks fun fleyshik vet men sheydn, vet aykh der Eybershter hitn fun tsores un laydn.

158
00:11:57,402 --> 00:12:01,395
dos iz geven ibern shafke un dos iz geven hant-arbet vunder sheyn oysgeneyt.

159
00:12:02,228 --> 00:12:09,903
nokh s'geven a mineg az fun vi lang fun yungvayz on hot men dos kind gelernt ⟨oysshtey⟩. m'flegt koyfn layvnt

160
00:12:09,903 --> 00:12:14,687
zikh shtikn aleyn hemder mit mit un vos s'geven. vunder-sheyne arbetn.

161
00:12:14,687 --> 00:12:17,730
UNK. haynt haynt al- makht men alts mit mashin.

162
00:12:18,310 --> 00:12:24,750
un di shabesdike tish vos ken keyner nisht fargesn.

163
00:12:24,992 --> 00:12:28,111
vel ikh aykh dertseyln an interesante sakh, dos darfn doyres visn.

164
00:12:28,111 --> 00:12:36,410
bay undz in shtetl fleg men az der tate fleg kumen fun shul fleg er tomed mitbrengen gest. mame iz tomed geven gerokhtn vayl s'flegn kumen farshidene

165
00:12:36,417 --> 00:12:39,144
flegn farshi- s'geven a sakh pleytim vos hobn

166
00:12:39,319 --> 00:12:44,387
zenen antlofn funem militer bahaltene, s'mentshn vos hobn nisht gehat keyn MAKOM vu tsu zayn.

167
00:12:44,387 --> 00:12:48,749
khuts mize iz dos kashres geven shver. s'geven UNK hobn gezukht a yidishe shtub.

168
00:12:48,749 --> 00:12:52,644
fleg men kumen in shul in yeder yid hot mitgenumen an oyrekh.

169
00:12:52,752 --> 00:12:55,457
khuts mize iz bay undz geven a bitere zakh.

170
00:12:55,457 --> 00:12:59,934
s'geven a, azoy heyst UNK nor vi azoy zogt men, a kazarme,

171
00:13:00,109 --> 00:13:02,704
vi heyst a kazarm? MACHANE TZVAI.

172
00:13:00,396 --> 00:13:01,726
MACHANE TZVAI?

173
00:13:02,704 --> 00:13:05,506
oyser di shtot. a groyse MACHANE TZVAI funem gants land,

174
00:13:05,506 --> 00:13:09,800
dort hot men genumen di rekrutn, dos heyst di vos geyen nor vos in militer.

175
00:13:09,800 --> 00:13:12,877
demolts hot men genumen yidn oykh, s'geven demokratish.

176
00:13:12,900 --> 00:13:17,546
vifl zey hobn zikh gekent oyskoyfn, antloyfn un bahaltn UNK, ober s'geven azolkhe

177
00:13:17,546 --> 00:13:22,125
bokherim fun di yeshive shtarke fun farshidene fun der gantser umgegung.

178
00:13:22,182 --> 00:13:27,035
bay undz iz geven der tsenterum, s'geven a groys feld un mir flegn makhn IMUNIM.

179
00:13:27,868 --> 00:13:33,819
di soldatn, vifl zey hobn gekent flegn zey araynkumen in shul, vifl nisht fleg der tate olev-asholem, di zkhus UNK,

180
00:13:34,129 --> 00:13:37,650
MESHACHED zayn ofitsirn, ofitsirn vi azoy heyst dos, KATZINIM,

181
00:13:37,690 --> 00:13:40,164
zoln aroyslozn di yidn oyf shabes.

182
00:13:40,626 --> 00:13:49,634
fleg der tate aheymkumen mit CHAYALIM. s'geven azoy min MUZAR, nor s'nisht geven keyn brey- breyre. flegn kumen yidn mit berd oykhet gest farshidene.

183
00:13:49,634 --> 00:13:51,268
un flegn kumen CHAYALIM.

184
00:13:52,590 --> 00:13:59,480
un di CHAYALIM, eyner iz gek- dos ershte vi lang s'nokh geven UNK tsu lozn di peyes, nor dernokh fleg men mit gevald tsu opshern di peyes.

185
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:03,817
iz eyner iz gekumen nokh dem un m'hot im opgeshoyrn di peyes. ikh vel dos in lebn nisht fargesn.

186
00:14:03,817 --> 00:14:07,783
der bokher hot gegosn fun mit trern, er iz geven fun Kluzh,

187
00:14:07,783 --> 00:14:11,377
fun a raykher a shtub, nor vos, er iz geven zeyer a fester, a hoykher.

188
00:14:11,377 --> 00:14:13,661
vorshaynlekh zey hobn zikh nisht gekent oyskoyfn.

189
00:14:13,920 --> 00:14:18,909
hot er gegosn mit trern, er hot zikh nisht gekent far far veytik vos m'hot im opgeshnitn di peyes.

190
00:14:19,185 --> 00:14:25,713
azoy az bay undz iz geven a shtub shabes mamesh az groyse sheyn tish mit gest un,

191
00:14:25,713 --> 00:14:30,958
mame ole-hasholem hot zeyer gearbet un undz ho'mir nisht vayl zi hot nisht gelozt az mir zol'mir nisht oysknetn di khale.

192
00:14:30,981 --> 00:14:34,842
un azolkhe zakhn bay di kekh hot zi nisht gevolt, zi hot zi gemuzt ales aleyn.

193
00:14:34,842 --> 00:14:39,142
nokh iz geven a mineg, ikh hob im shoyn etlekhe mol dertseylt, nor ikh vil im vayter dertseyln.

194
00:14:39,553 --> 00:14:45,723
bay undz fleg men bakn aleyn broyt un khale un ales, mir ho'mir gornisht gekoyft. ales mishum kashres.

195
00:14:46,557 --> 00:14:51,093
un az di mame ole- dos vel ikh keyn mol nisht fargesn, m'hot gebakn khale un broyt un

196
00:14:51,093 --> 00:14:55,691
kukhn farshidene. bay undz iz geven kukurits mel iz geven di

197
00:14:55,691 --> 00:15:01,024
OCHEL fun di fun AMAMI, nor di yidn flegn es oykh nitsn, nor di yidn flegn es makhn mit tsuker, mit ayer.

198
00:15:01,024 --> 00:15:02,902
undz flegn gebn afile tsum kidesh.

199
00:15:03,381 --> 00:15:06,423
s'geven a groyse tish un di mame hot genumen khale.

200
00:15:06,423 --> 00:15:09,503
un ikh vel dos keyn mol nisht fargesn dos bild. di mame zi hot genumen khale,

201
00:15:09,503 --> 00:15:13,469
koydem hot men gezen m'hot avekgeshikt di dinst, zi zol nisht in shtub demolts.

202
00:15:13,469 --> 00:15:20,025
hot zi geleygt oyf dem iz geven a sheyn vays tish, m'hot geleygt ale UNK, azoy oyfn tish,

203
00:15:20,025 --> 00:15:21,704
a sheyn vays tishtekh deroyf,

204
00:15:21,704 --> 00:15:25,937
mame hot zikh ongetun dos shirtsele fun khale-lekht-tsindn un dos vayse tikhele,

205
00:15:26,078 --> 00:15:32,940
un m'hot genumen khale. ikh zog aykh, ven s'do a mayle un m'tseylt dos bild vi azoy, mamesh a a avoyde.

206
00:15:33,891 --> 00:15:39,319
m'hot genumen, bay undz fleg men zogn, genumen a shtikl fun yedn khale un gezogt 'borekh hu uborekh shmoy', bay aykh hot dos oykh bakant?

207
00:15:39,358 --> 00:15:41,815
yo, undz makhn dos shtend-

208
00:15:39,375 --> 00:15:42,992
iber ale, untern tishtekh, 'borekh hu uborekh shmoy',

209
00:15:42,210 --> 00:15:42,997
yo.

210
00:15:42,992 --> 00:15:44,972
un dernokh 'lehafrish khale'.

211
00:15:44,995 --> 00:15:52,628
un dernokh tkhines, gebetn far di kinder, zoln vaksn, zoln zayn talmide-khakhomim, gegosn trern.

212
00:15:52,628 --> 00:15:56,143
un der Eybershter zol hitn fun tsores, vayl s'hot shoyn ongehoybn di unruen.

213
00:15:56,301 --> 00:16:01,006
un undz kinderlekh fleg'mir bay shteyn arum der mame, vayl dernokh baym knetn

214
00:16:01,006 --> 00:16:08,279
az undz ze'mir geven voyl, undz ze'mir yunge meydelekh, hot zi ongetun s'zol kholile nisht araynfaln a hor in teyg, ontun tikhelekh, gut farbindn dos hor,

215
00:16:08,279 --> 00:16:10,487
un undz gebn yedn a shtikele teyg.

216
00:16:10,948 --> 00:16:15,088
az undz zol'mir, ven zi hot ibergemakht di khales zol'mir mitmakhn.

217
00:16:15,088 --> 00:16:22,772
iz vos iz geven? dem tate olev-asho- s'geven aza aza mineg bay undz, er iz nisht geven keyn rebe, nor m'hot gemakht a yud-beys khale, a sheyne yud-veys khale, UNK.

218
00:16:22,812 --> 00:16:25,517
un far di brider iz geven kleyne bekelekh,

219
00:16:25,517 --> 00:16:30,281
iz di meydelekh hobn gemakht far di brider yud-beys khales azelkhe kleyne, dos iz geven undzer arbet.

220
00:16:30,456 --> 00:16:34,938
azoy hot men langzam hot men tsugetsoygn di yugnt az m'zol lib hobn di mitsve.

221
00:16:35,097 --> 00:16:39,388
di di libshaft tsu di mitsve. dos iz geven ayngepreglt in di beyner.

222
00:16:39,388 --> 00:16:43,159
ad hayom, azoy ikh gey nisht khale-nemen on on lekht-tsindn shirtsl.

223
00:16:43,159 --> 00:16:51,184
ikh veys ven s'zet mikh emetser, ikh tu es bederkh klal ven s- nisht un f- un afile ven yo, ikh hob mikh nisht vos tsu shemen, nor

224
00:16:47,466 --> 00:16:48,945
keyner iz nishto.

225
00:16:51,184 --> 00:16:55,796
gelernt ikh hob es als kind, do hob ikh es nisht gezen. ikh ken mikh derfun nisht opgevoynen.

226
00:16:56,663 --> 00:17:02,616
ober vos iz geven derfun? azoy hot ayngelernt di ayngepreglt dos yidishkeyt in di kinder.

227
00:17:02,616 --> 00:17:07,541
tsum bayshpil, bay undz hot men kosher gemakht fleysh, undz hobn genutst nor oyfn fleysh, undz ho'mir nisht genutst keyn rindern fleysh

228
00:17:07,598 --> 00:17:10,834
ale yorn vos undz hobn gelebt in di Bukovine, far vos?

229
00:17:10,834 --> 00:17:15,019
vayl dos iz hot men gemuzt shekhtn oyser di shtot in in

230
00:17:15,019 --> 00:17:22,239
fun di IRYA vi azoy m'zogt iz geven a groys shekht-hoyz. hot men geshokhtn far di gantse shtot. dort flegn shekhtn shokhtim.

231
00:17:22,482 --> 00:17:28,992
ober s'iz zeyer zeyer shver geven di bdikes m'zol oysfirn azoy vi m'hot gevolt hobn mehadrin lemehadrin s'zol zayn kosher iz es geven shver,

232
00:17:28,992 --> 00:17:33,582
ho'mir tsvontsik yor iber iber tsvontsik ho'mir gelebt in di Bukovine undz ho'mir nisht gegesn keyn rindern fleysh, nor of.

233
00:17:33,582 --> 00:17:40,045
hitst iz azoy. a of hot men gekoyft in in SHUK un m'iz gegangen tsum shoykhet, oykhet geven shokh- fir shokhtim.

234
00:17:40,045 --> 00:17:41,682
hot men nisht geshokhtn bay yedn.

235
00:17:41,682 --> 00:17:46,162
eyner hot, shtelt zikh for vi azoy m'hot medakdek geven. eyner hot gehat a zun

236
00:17:46,162 --> 00:17:52,547
vos er iz geforn als CHALUTZ fun in dakht zikh mir a bisl a frayheyt partey keyn Erets-Yisroel, hot men shoyn bay im nisht geshokhtn.

237
00:17:53,582 --> 00:17:55,972
ad kedey kakh iz geven di DIKDUK.

238
00:17:56,265 --> 00:18:00,022
yetst az di mame hot kosher gemakht, fleg'mir oykh zitsn arings un arum,

239
00:18:00,923 --> 00:18:03,493
hot zi genumen dos kosher-bretl,

240
00:18:03,493 --> 00:18:07,295
bay undz hot men afile dos kepele genutst, vayl s'zeyer shver tsu bakumen a,

241
00:18:07,605 --> 00:18:12,031
vi azoy m'makht kosher an of, hob ikh shoyn geven a kind, m'hot nisht gelozt kosher makhn.

242
00:18:12,031 --> 00:18:14,453
fleg mir shteyn UNK hot gezogt azoy m'heybt on azoy.

243
00:18:14,453 --> 00:18:17,741
m'shnaydt op di fiselekh, di shpits fun di negl darf men opshnaydn.

244
00:18:17,798 --> 00:18:22,418
nokh leygt men es oyf azoy, un m'efnt es un m'nemt glaykhtntsam aroys ales.

245
00:18:22,418 --> 00:18:27,866
un m'bakukt koydem tsi s'nishto tsvey leberlekh oder tsvey,

246
00:18:27,906 --> 00:18:32,358
dinim gelernt, vos ikh hob zey gelernt fun di mame azoy fun a Shulkhn-Orekh.

247
00:18:32,358 --> 00:18:35,707
nokh iz bay undz geven a groyse zakh, zeyer oyfes zenen geven fray,

248
00:18:35,707 --> 00:18:43,729
flegn zey kloybn vos s'hot zikh gelozt un az s'geven a mol dos vaser iz nisht geven gut, flegn zey bakumen pokn oyf di kishkes.

249
00:18:43,819 --> 00:18:46,428
fleg undz di mame UNK dos iz a pok,

250
00:18:46,890 --> 00:18:51,491
un nokh hot men geefnt dem dem dem KURKUVAN, vi azoy heyst dos, dos pupikl,

251
00:18:51,109 --> 00:18:52,132
yo,

252
00:18:51,700 --> 00:18:56,160
dos iz geven a gantse BAYA, ven m'hot es geefnt, UNK geven bay dos efenen,

253
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:59,574
un dernokh ken men haltn azoy, zen tsi s'nishto a shteyndele

254
00:18:59,580 --> 00:19:05,615
oder a nodele, vayl zey flegn ales oyfkloybn. bay undz iz geven a verkshtat, undz hobn gehat di hiner oykh fun fun tomer iz nisht geven tsu koyfn.

255
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:10,594
tomer iz geven a shayle hot men ge- shoyn als kind hob ikh gevust, mame dos iz a shayle.

256
00:19:10,903 --> 00:19:16,283
dos hob ikh shoyn gevust afile, tomer iz der nodl vos zi hot ayngeshlungen nisht derkhgeshtokhn derkh un derkh vet es zayn kosher.

257
00:19:16,283 --> 00:19:19,351
nor aleyn hot men nisht gepasket, m'iz gegangen tsum rov.

258
00:19:19,898 --> 00:19:23,216
nokh iz geven ir hert, ir veyst nisht vos dos heyst, do varft men avek

259
00:19:23,256 --> 00:19:28,298
dos kepl un dos kepl iz geven a gantser yikhes, vayl s'hot gemakht gut di tam fun di zupe.

260
00:19:28,298 --> 00:19:32,129
kosher makhn a kepl iz mamesh darf men zayn a groyser fakhman.

261
00:19:32,129 --> 00:19:36,812
s'iz nisht di tsayt ikh zol dertseyln. un undz m'hot dos ales gelernt, tsurikkukndik,

262
00:19:36,812 --> 00:19:42,557
bay der mame ven zi zi hot dos oyfn tish iz geven a bretl kosher tsu makhn,

263
00:19:42,557 --> 00:19:50,556
un azoy redndik stam hot zi undz oytomatish ho'mir gelernt kosher tsu makhn an of un vi azoy tsu zaltsn.

264
00:19:50,556 --> 00:19:55,481
ven zi hot ven ikh bin geven far di khasene hob ikh shoyn gedarft aleyn zal- neyn, shoyn als meydl fleg zi mikh lozn.

265
00:19:55,875 --> 00:20:01,533
hot zi koydem dermit, bay undz fleg men nisht zaltsn azoy vi do azoy fil, vayl s'hot gedarft zayn azoy vi shney, oyf yedn UNK glaykh.

266
00:20:01,533 --> 00:20:05,862
hot zi mir gegebn a shtikl papir, un mir gegebn a bisl zalts in di hent,

267
00:20:05,862 --> 00:20:15,295
un hot mikh gelernt vi azoy ikh zol umgeyn mitn zalts az s'zol oyskumen yede zayt glaykh. fun vu onheybn, un vu oyfheybn. vu veyst men dos haynt? m'veyst dos andersh.

268
00:20:15,295 --> 00:20:19,716
shoyn, azoy hot zikh undz ayngepreglt dos yidishkeyt fun kindvayz oys,

269
00:20:19,716 --> 00:20:22,937
azoy hot di mame getun, azoy ho'mir zikh gefirt.

270
00:20:23,196 --> 00:20:27,020
un tsum bayshpil iz geven, vos m'ken nisht azoy azoy,

271
00:20:27,415 --> 00:20:35,545
bay undz iz geven tsum bayshpil di MISRA- di verkshtat iz geven fornt in shtub, flegn kumen di sokhrim zikh opforn, oprekhenen,

272
00:20:35,545 --> 00:20:41,786
s'geven ekstere shtub, un undz kinder, a mol gresere meydelekh, zogt di mame, "kinder, az s'do mentshn in shtub

273
00:20:41,961 --> 00:20:45,852
lakht men nisht azoy hoykh, vos iz dos? shtil, m'tor dokh nisht hern dos kol!"

274
00:20:45,994 --> 00:20:51,422
fun anfang hot men undz oysgelernt, vos iz azoy m- azoy la- l- la- la- la- lakht a yidishe tokhter?

275
00:20:51,968 --> 00:20:54,274
vos far a fabrik hot ets gehat dortn?

276
00:20:53,385 --> 00:20:57,682
ikh vil dokh aykh ober dertseyln fun birstn, MIV- MIVRASHOT.

277
00:20:56,001 --> 00:20:56,585
aha.

278
00:20:57,807 --> 00:21:00,368
farshidnerley farshidene.

279
00:21:00,368 --> 00:21:04,027
dan hot men gearbet far der TZAVA vos zey hobn gedarft hobn farshidene zakhn.

280
00:21:06,497 --> 00:21:16,380
gedenk ir nokh zakhn fun di shtot, fun di shtetl vos ir hot gevoynt, fun di yidishe velt fun di shtot? iz geven tsaytungen do-,yidishe tsaytungen?

281
00:21:15,036 --> 00:21:19,670
tsaytungen fleg mir bakumen fun Tshernovits, Tshernovits iz geven di hoypt-shtot fun di Bukovine.

282
00:21:19,508 --> 00:21:20,312
aha.

283
00:21:20,065 --> 00:21:24,632
un dort fleg mir bakumen Tagblat, dakht zikh mir az Taglat hot es geheysn dos yidishe tsaytung, yo.

284
00:21:23,237 --> 00:21:24,429
yo.

285
00:21:24,688 --> 00:21:29,204
undz ho'mir nokh nisht gekent azoy gut leyenen, di mame fleg undz forleyenen vi lang undz ze'mir kleyn geven.

286
00:21:29,515 --> 00:21:33,947
un dernokh fleg gegan- fleg bakumen eyn tsaytung fleg es gebn fun eyn shtub in der anderer.

287
00:21:34,071 --> 00:21:38,790
a beys-oylem iz yo gevezn dortn? a beys-oylem iz gevezn bay enk in shtot?

288
00:21:35,725 --> 00:21:36,664
vos?

289
00:21:38,442 --> 00:21:44,882
zekher iz geven oylem, fleg kumen a rebe fleg men zitsn in der Byaner shul. a a ir meynt, yo, yo.

290
00:21:41,513 --> 00:21:44,134
a beys-oylem, a beys-kvores.

291
00:21:44,134 --> 00:21:44,865
yo.

292
00:21:44,938 --> 00:21:48,234
a groys s'iz nisht tseshtert, s'shoyn geven mentshn dortn oyf keyver-oves.

293
00:21:48,234 --> 00:21:51,462
lign di di kvorim, zey hobn nisht getshepet gornisht.

294
00:21:51,250 --> 00:21:52,073
aha.

295
00:21:51,553 --> 00:21:57,785
a groys, s'geven, neyn. yeshives nisht geven, nor khadorim, talmed-toyres, iz geven etlekhe.

296
00:21:52,073 --> 00:21:54,264
un yeshives zenen gevezn dortn?

297
00:21:55,772 --> 00:21:56,913
khado-

298
00:21:57,662 --> 00:21:59,546
vu hobn gelernt di bokherim?

299
00:21:57,785 --> 00:21:59,034
ven s'geven,

300
00:22:00,058 --> 00:22:06,383
bokherim, mayn man iz geven a bokher fun zibetsn yor ven hot er gelernt in Vizhnits.

301
00:22:06,383 --> 00:22:16,455
mayne brider zenen geven zeks zibn yerike kinder, hot men nokh nisht UNK. di andere iz nor, oder iz ver s'geven raykh un er iz geven a guter kop, hot men untershtitst tsu forn keyn Poyln, keyn Lublin.

302
00:22:08,614 --> 00:22:11,645
aha. un di andere kinder, di andere bokherim hobn nisht,

303
00:22:16,225 --> 00:22:17,012
aha.

304
00:22:17,220 --> 00:22:19,391
un dos rest hot gelernt in Vizhnits.

305
00:22:19,195 --> 00:22:19,931
aha.

306
00:22:19,752 --> 00:22:20,347
yo.

307
00:22:20,347 --> 00:22:21,908
di vos hobn gehat gresere kinder.

308
00:22:21,908 --> 00:22:25,331
bay undz iz dos nokh nisht geven vayl m'hot undz avekgeshikt keyn Kresnist.

309
00:22:25,388 --> 00:22:27,997
gedenkt ir purim, peysekh in shtot?

310
00:22:28,054 --> 00:22:35,434
purim, peysekh in shtot, iber bakn matses ken ikh dertseyln un dertseyln.

311
00:22:35,412 --> 00:22:36,351
aha.

312
00:22:35,434 --> 00:22:38,766
dos iz geven mamesh avoydas hakoydesh. hot zikh ongehoybn fun zumer.

313
00:22:38,766 --> 00:22:45,682
fleg men geyn azoy vi do sh- v- veyts, trikenen veyts, in di felder, nor dos iz geven normale tsayt.

314
00:22:45,688 --> 00:22:50,677
nokh fleg men geyn far peysekh kashern di mil, dos iz geven oyser di shtot, a groyse mil.

315
00:22:51,021 --> 00:22:55,031
flegn zikh tsunoyfnemen ale yidishe yidn fun ale, un geyn mitn rov.

316
00:22:55,037 --> 00:22:59,447
m'fleg kashern di mil, dos iz geven dem tog fun moln veyts. nokh hot men bahandlt dos UNK.

317
00:22:59,447 --> 00:23:01,866
nokh bakn matses hot men gebakn

318
00:23:02,192 --> 00:23:07,906
bay mayn mume, bay der zol zikh mien. zi hot groyse tsimern, flegn zikh tsunoyfnemen etlekhe balebatim oyf etlekhe erter,

319
00:23:08,098 --> 00:23:11,265
un m'fleg bakn aleyn matses.

320
00:23:11,608 --> 00:23:16,293
mayn olev-asholem iz geven a kintsler baym shibn di matses. yeder hot gehat zayn TAFKID.

321
00:23:16,468 --> 00:23:23,105
ober vos iz geven, s'geven a groyse matses fabrik oykhet far di shtot, unter azoy zeyer a groyse hashgokhe.

322
00:23:23,105 --> 00:23:26,894
nor undz ho'mir dos nisht genutst. nokh peysekh hot men genutst far di kinder.

323
00:23:26,894 --> 00:23:30,384
iz geven a groyse matse fabrik, vayl Redevits iz normale tsaytn geven

324
00:23:30,508 --> 00:23:34,319
a sakh yidishe bafelkerung un zey flegn araynkumen di yidn fun di derfer.

325
00:23:34,319 --> 00:23:36,713
nor undz ho'mir gebakn matses aleyn.

326
00:23:37,157 --> 00:23:43,462
dos iz geven. oykh aleyn, hot gehat a kleynem vayn-pres.

327
00:23:38,828 --> 00:23:41,032
un vayn fun vanet hot ets genumen?

328
00:23:41,072 --> 00:23:44,137
oykh aleyn. aha.

329
00:23:44,127 --> 00:23:48,756
un s'geven in in vi azoy, in herbst heyst herbst in STOV,

330
00:23:48,733 --> 00:23:49,773
yo,

331
00:23:48,756 --> 00:23:51,666
iz geven flegn mir, un bay undz hot nisht gevaksn keyn troybn,

332
00:23:51,666 --> 00:23:54,974
UNK ho'mir gebrengt fun erter fun vu s'geven a sakh troybn,

333
00:23:54,974 --> 00:23:58,448
groyse transportn, flegn zikh oykh tsunoyfnemen etlekhe balebatim,

334
00:23:58,470 --> 00:24:01,282
un m'hot in der kleyner pres mit der hant

335
00:24:01,390 --> 00:24:06,818
gemakht vayn un dos hot men bahaltn ekstere peysekhdik. shmalts fleg men bay undz makhn,

336
00:24:07,959 --> 00:24:12,186
undz ho'mir nisht gevust keyn SHEMEN, nor vos shmalts undz ho'mir aleyn gemakht genumen fun gendz.

337
00:24:12,186 --> 00:24:15,046
iz geven khanuke tsayt iz geven di tsayt fun di gendz,

338
00:24:15,046 --> 00:24:19,805
hot men peysekhdik, iz gevorn peysekhdik in shtub, m'hot zikh oykh tsunoyfgenumen tsvey dray shokhntes,

339
00:24:19,805 --> 00:24:21,687
un m'hot kosher gemakht gendz,

340
00:24:21,687 --> 00:24:27,121
m'hot di shmalts hot men oyfgetoplt oyf peysekh, un di ho'mir gehat azelkhe UNK, azelkhe groyse UNK.

341
00:24:27,121 --> 00:24:29,177
undz ho'mir gehat sh- s'geven shtark kalt,

342
00:24:29,267 --> 00:24:32,934
m'hot dos gekent haltn in shpayz, s'geven gut gefroyrn.

343
00:24:32,934 --> 00:24:35,809
dos fleysh hot men gereykhert. azoy,

344
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:39,993
iz geven in dem koymen vos mir hobn geheytst iz geven gemakht azelkhe stra-

345
00:24:40,641 --> 00:24:46,839
shinen azoy vi UNK, dos hot men geleygt di breter un fun dem roykh iz tsaytvayz opgerunen, dos iz geshtanen dos hot men genutst a gants

346
00:24:46,839 --> 00:24:51,030
a gantsn vinter, fun di gendz, vayl m'hot dokh gemuzt mit a mol, s'zol zayn.

347
00:24:51,087 --> 00:24:52,526
azoy ot undz ho'mir gornisht,

348
00:24:52,526 --> 00:24:57,763
tey hot men oyfgekokht un gezign, tsuker hot men oyfgekokht un gezign,

349
00:24:58,343 --> 00:25:06,167
ikh veys epes azolkhe min khumres, ikh veys nisht, do erloybt men zikh azoy fil. s'do zakhn vos ikh hob nokh gehaltn bi- biz ikh hob gekent, ober dernokh,

350
00:25:06,971 --> 00:25:11,229
s'do ales do mit a hekhsher, s- yo yo.

351
00:25:07,692 --> 00:25:11,229
do iz do kashres shoyn, un a hekhsher, s'iz s'iz andersh.

352
00:25:11,269 --> 00:25:12,377
UNK.

353
00:25:11,320 --> 00:25:16,413
purim iz geven zeyer freylekh, normale tsaytn, az m'hot nisht bavorfn mit shteyner.

354
00:25:16,413 --> 00:25:18,839
fleg mir zikh farshteln, iber hoypt di,

355
00:25:18,897 --> 00:25:20,072
shlakhmones?

356
00:25:18,947 --> 00:25:24,605
s- shlakhmones, vos heyst shlakhmones? geshikt eyner tsum andern.

357
00:25:24,605 --> 00:25:28,681
un khuts mize flegn zayn di, vi azoy ruft men,

358
00:25:28,681 --> 00:25:31,052
Tseire Agudas Yisroel iz geven bokherim,

359
00:25:31,052 --> 00:25:37,031
ikh gedenk zey koym, zey flegn zikh farshteln, m'flegt kumen zingen, s'geven zeyer zeyer freylekh.

360
00:25:37,628 --> 00:25:38,752
dos hot,

361
00:25:37,797 --> 00:25:45,401
iz gevezn reg- reorganizirt tsdoke gesheftn fun di kehile, gedenkt ir?

362
00:25:44,428 --> 00:25:47,497
yo. geven KUPAT gemakh.

363
00:25:47,497 --> 00:25:57,208
un s'geven KUPOT far pidyen-shvuim hot dos geheysn. ir veyst vayl m'fleg flegn ale fleg men gebn funem antloyfn funem militer un az tomer hot men gekhapt eynem

364
00:25:57,208 --> 00:25:58,799
iz geven tsipke tsores,

365
00:25:58,840 --> 00:26:03,283
un dermit m'zol im nisht tsurikshikn keyn Poyln, tsi keyn Tshekhay, fun vu nor er iz antlofn,

366
00:26:03,283 --> 00:26:08,621
fleg men gebn shoykhed di baamtn. oyf dem hot men gedarft a groysn fond.

367
00:26:08,661 --> 00:26:12,623
s'fleg nisht zayn a mol genug, fleg der tate olev-asholem mit nokh gute yidn geyn,

368
00:26:12,623 --> 00:26:17,565
m'hot oysgeleyzt dem yid un dernokh fleg men tsunoyfnemen dos gelt tsu dekn az s'zol zayn vayter.

369
00:26:19,917 --> 00:26:23,876
un s'iz gevezn yidn vos hobn nisht ge- nisht gehat fun vos tsu lebn dortn?

370
00:26:24,658 --> 00:26:27,706
s'geven vos m'hot geshikt oyf shabes.

371
00:26:25,232 --> 00:26:27,251
m'hot zey geholfn?

372
00:26:27,814 --> 00:26:34,114
un nu s'geven tsdoke beseyser vos di mame hot ekster getun. dos iz geven ofitsyel

373
00:26:34,114 --> 00:26:39,941
iz geven shokhntes vos hobn zikh nisht geshemt tsu nemen, zi hot nisht getort visn az az m'git zey.

374
00:26:40,960 --> 00:26:44,818
mitn babe ole-hasholem, ikh gedenk es vi haynt, s'geven shtark a,

375
00:26:45,027 --> 00:26:51,871
hot zi zi hot gehaltn aleyn a ku zol kenen onkoyfn, vayl azoy fleg mir geyn tsun a goy melkn,

376
00:26:52,654 --> 00:26:53,798
un fleg,

